{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1359970-pentragram-of-venus-charting-the-course-of-the-five-maidens-of-fate","id":1359970,"title":"Pentragram of Venus - charting the course of the Five Maidens of Fate","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-01-09T14:33:08-08:00","id":1359970,"title":"Pentragram of Venus - charting the course of the Five Maidens of Fate","content":"So, Exalted's <i>Creation</i> is essentially geocentric. Everything revolves around the Elemental Pole of Earth, the world is flat, the stars are lights affixed to a solid ceiling called the firmament... except for the five planets, but word &quot;planet&quot; means &quot;wanderer&quot;.<br /> <br /> But what courses do the wanderers take?<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pentagram#/media/File%3AVenus_geocentric_orbit_curve_simplified_Line_(pentagram).svg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><a href=\"https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pentagram#/media/File%3AVenus_geocentric_orbit_curve_simplified_Line_(pentagram).svg\" target=\"_blank\">https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pent...pentagram).svg</a><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.astrosoftware.com/PlanetMandalasAndNewScience.htm\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"http://www.astrosoftware.com/ABOUTHEA.JPG\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.astrosoftware.com/PlanetMandalasAndNewScience.htm\" target=\"_blank\"> PLANET MANDALAS AND NEW SCIENCE </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.astrosoftware.com/PlanetMandalasAndNewScience.htm\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.astrosoftware.com/PlanetMandalasAndNewScience.htm </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> David Cochrane, Cosmic Cybernetics, Freud's Psychoanalytic Theories, A Post-Freudian Perspective, Freud, Kepler, </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Apparently, if you track and plot the course of Venus in a geocentric model, Venus describes a pentragram of petals. Very pretty, and very &quot;symmetrical&quot;.<br /> <br /> If you do the same with Mars, you get a similar pattern, but not a pentragram, and not quite as symmetrical. The petals of one side are larger than the other.<br /> <br /> I'm having difficulty finding diagrams for the other three &quot;classical&quot; planets: Mercury, Jupiter, and Saturn.<br /> <br /> Here's a video of Jupiter. <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OYADP0v8pqA\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OYADP0v8pqA</a><br /> <br /> Here's a video of Neptune. <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SL4JI7UdaL0\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SL4JI7UdaL0</a><br /> <br /> This guy seems to have videos for each planet, and this diagram of Mars is different from the still image of the second linked website. <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JE0mPP_capw\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JE0mPP_capw</a><br /> <br /> <br /> I wonder what these diagrams look like when overlaid on each other.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-09T18:05:43-08:00","id":1360014,"title":"","content":"Given that Astrology is a thing in Creation and it accurately gives information about the future, I don\u2019t think the planets, at least, can have fixed courses. I mean, if Venus needs to be in the House of the Hawk Star tomorrow to communicate some omen, it will be, regardless of where it \u201cshould\u201d be.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}